Z||000011||Jim Jimenez||07-17-2001||02:28 AM||||I recently installed AC in my Formula. It is no picknik, and not for the meek.  Best to have a '84 parts car, a factory shop manual, and a lot of time. Bob Steiger once quoted me two Grand to do the installation.  <BR>  Keep in mind that I am a pretty well versed wrench guy myself who is a GM Parts manager. <BR>And by the way, mine works "great"||||reg||1
